{
  "source": "course-assets/understand-ai-opener/understand-ai-opener.mp4",
  "duration": 148.0533125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.2,
      "text": "It's not magic, it's not a person, and it's definitely not normal software."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.96,
      "end": 10.98,
      "text": "It is entirely its own kind of thing, operating by a completely different set of rules."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.66,
      "end": 16.84,
      "text": "Sometimes, working with AI feels like you have a PhD expert sitting right beside you,"
    },
    {
      "start": 17.14,
      "end": 19.18,
      "text": "handing you brilliant insights in seconds."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.98,
      "end": 25.04,
      "text": "Other times, it makes the kind of glaring illogical mistake you'd expect from a six-year-old."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.04,
      "end": 28.94,
      "text": "How can the exact same tool operate at both of those extremes?"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.64,
      "end": 35.0,
      "text": "Understanding what actually happens underneath explains why it behaves the way it does."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.64,
      "end": 36.82,
      "text": "Think about driving a car."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.44,
      "end": 41.0,
      "text": "You can get perfectly good at it without ever opening the hood to look at the engine."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.66,
      "end": 45.98,
      "text": "But if you don't know what's happening in there, you won't fully grasp what the vehicle can handle,"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.48,
      "end": 48.88,
      "text": "or diagnose why it suddenly stalls on the highway."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.56,
      "end": 51.0,
      "text": "The same goes for artificial intelligence."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.64,
      "end": 56.7,
      "text": "Learning what's happening under the hood gives you a clearer picture of its actual capabilities."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.62,
      "end": 63.72,
      "text": "Knowing how it works helps you use it thoughtfully, ensuring you remain smarter than the tool you're operating."
    },
    {
      "start": 64.94,
      "end": 71.1,
      "text": "We are going to take you inside the machine, but you don't need to memorize a dictionary of technical terms."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.74,
      "end": 75.56,
      "text": "Our single goal here is to help you understand a specific transformation,"
    },
    {
      "start": 76.26,
      "end": 79.34,
      "text": "how the words you type turn into the answer you receive."
    },
    {
      "start": 80.46,
      "end": 83.4,
      "text": "This road map shows what we'll explore in this section."
    },
    {
      "start": 84.14,
      "end": 87.74,
      "text": "To be clear, the numbers on this map represent our order of learning,"
    },
    {
      "start": 88.2,
      "end": 92.12,
      "text": "not a five-step sequence the AI runs through every time you send a message."
    },
    {
      "start": 92.86,
      "end": 94.66,
      "text": "We'll start with how AI learned."
    },
    {
      "start": 95.44,
      "end": 99.64,
      "text": "Looking at how initial training builds the patterns the system relies on to answer you."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.26,
      "end": 104.96,
      "text": "Second is why probability matters, where we see how the information the AI possesses"
    },
    {
      "start": 104.96,
      "end": 107.82,
      "text": "dictates what word is most likely to come next."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.82,
      "end": 110.38,
      "text": "Third, how words become numbers."
    },
    {
      "start": 111.3,
      "end": 114.9,
      "text": "We'll break down how text is chopped into smaller pieces called tokens,"
    },
    {
      "start": 115.58,
      "end": 118.66,
      "text": "and how those tokens are assigned numbers representing their meaning."
    },
    {
      "start": 119.6,
      "end": 121.68,
      "text": "Fourth is how meaning takes shape."
    },
    {
      "start": 122.5,
      "end": 124.62,
      "text": "Here we'll see how words influence each other,"
    },
    {
      "start": 125.2,
      "end": 128.02,
      "text": "altering their assigned numbers and mathematical relationships."
    },
    {
      "start": 129.18,
      "end": 132.42,
      "text": "Finally, how AI builds an answer ties it all together."
    },
    {
      "start": 133.04,
      "end": 134.92,
      "text": "We look at the final construction process,"
    },
    {
      "start": 134.92,
      "end": 138.6,
      "text": "why the answers vary, and just how much math goes into it."
    },
    {
      "start": 139.78,
      "end": 141.74,
      "text": "The machine won't feel like magic anymore."
    },
    {
      "start": 142.5,
      "end": 143.62,
      "text": "Take it a piece at a time."
    }
  ],
